     "titulo": "Unreal past hypothesis",
     "texto": [
      "**Se tivesse estudado, teria passado** (if I had studied, I would have passed). The condition takes **se + tivesse/fosse + participle** and the result usually takes **teria + participle**.",
      "In European Portuguese the imperfect can also appear: **Se tivesse estudado, passava**. The context shows that a past situation that did not happen is being talked about."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
